{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the 90s in this collection of classic Nickelodeon games that includes GUTS, Rocko's Modern Life: Spunky's Dangerous Day, and both versions of\u00a0AAAHH!!! Real Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have it? In <strong>GUTS</strong>, you can take part in the legendary sports-action show and compete in classic events to test your mettle before you reach the radical rock itself - <strong><i>the Aggro Crag</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocko's Modern Life: Spunky's Dangerous Day</strong> is a unique puzzle platforming game where you have to guide Spunky out of harm's way. The game takes you across sixteen hazard-filled levels and locales inspired by the show itself. You might even run into some of O-Town's most well-know residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, in\u00a0<strong>AAAHH!!! Real Monsters</strong> you get to take direct control of everyone's favorite monsters - Ickis, Oblina, and Krumm! Both versions are included, so you can leave the console wars in the 90s and re-experience the game on your preferred 16-bit machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the games themselves. several extra features are included:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind: Made a mistake? Don't worry! You can rewind to try again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Anywhere: Need a break? Bring up the menu and save your game whenever you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Player: Just want to listen to the great music in these games? We've got you covered!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Screaming ABCD 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Poltergeisting 2A 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Nightmares 2B 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"People Petrifying 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Hiding For Horror 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Screaming ABCD Nightmare 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Poltergeisting 2A Nightmare 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Nightmares 2B Nightmare 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"People Petrifying Nightmare 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"},{"name":"Hiding For Horror Nightmare 16-BIT Mega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509130/f09e7e7469eeca2b1f99dfbb6f171c4fbc358cde.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509130?t=1769784789","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509130?t=1769784789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509130/8639d6014b5bbfd5cd1dfd3e2a066b4141fd4bad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769784789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509130/8639d6